# Keep host build artifacts out of the image build context: a local/VPS-side
# `docker build` would otherwise COPY bin/obj/node_modules over the restored
# layers and break the build with mismatched project.assets.json paths.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.angular/
.git/
.github/
.playwright-mcp/
docs/
action/
tmp/
*.md
.env
*.pem
